        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para repeler ataques, solidifica el aire y crea muros\ninvisibles con emanaciones de sus dedos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとを　しんじこませるのが　うまい。\nパントマイムで　つくったカベが\nほんとうに　あらわれるという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람 속이기를 잘한다.\n팬터마임으로 만든 벽이\n정말로 나타난다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il adore imiter les gens. On le dit capable de créer\nde véritables murs juste en les mimant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist geschickt darin, Menschen zu beeinflussen.\nMan sagt, es könne dünne Wände aus Luft nur durch\nMimen entstehen lassen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dicen que puede hacer un muro a partir del aire\nmediante la pantomima. Es experto en crear ilusiones\nópticas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si diletta a imbrogliare la gente. Si dice che sia in\ngrado di creare pareti d’aria servendosi della mimica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is adept at conning people. It is said to be able\nto create walls out of thin air by miming.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人を　信じこませるのが　うまい。\nパントマイムで　作った　壁が\n本当に　現れるという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dicen que puede hacer un muro a partir del aire\nmediante la pantomima. Es experto en crear ilusiones\nópticas.",
      "language": {
